# Remit-Scout Brand Color Conventions

## Two primary section backgrounds — no gradients

| Role | Tailwind class | Usage |
|------|---------------|-------|
| Light blue | `bg-brand-600` | Hero accents, CTA banners, testimonials, highlighted sections |
| Dark (navy) | `bg-neutral-900` | Dark sections: Plus teaser, FAQ, newsletter, footer, institutional teaser |

**No gradients.** Do not use `bg-gradient-to-*`, `from-brand-*`, `via-brand-*`, or `to-brand-*` on section backgrounds. Use the flat colors above.

## Text on dark (`bg-neutral-900`) sections
- Primary: `text-white`
- Secondary: `text-white/70` or `text-white/60`
- Muted: `text-white/40` or `text-white/35`
- Accent label: `text-brand-400`

## Text on light blue (`bg-brand-600`) sections
- Primary: `text-white`
- Secondary: `text-white/90`

## CTA buttons
- On dark backgrounds: `bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-500 text-white`
- On light/white backgrounds: `bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white`

## Do not use
- `bg-brand-950` for section backgrounds
- `bg-brand-900` for section backgrounds
- Any gradient on section-level backgrounds
- `bg-neutral-800` for card containers in dark sections — use `bg-white/5 border border-white/10` instead
